#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD0058-E expect=skipped domain=BW
#note "Scope.Domains.Include is CO, DM and SE only, so BW is out of FDA-SD0058-E scope: SEND BW is checked by the parent FDA-SD0058. BWCUSTOM is a sponsor variable in no model list and no IG list, so the check would report it at ERROR if the Include scope were dropped."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1
#library model-column-order BW STUDYID DOMAIN USUBJID BWSEQ BWTESTCD BWTEST BWORRES
dataset BW
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col BWSEQ type=Num
col BWTESTCD type=Char
col BWTEST type=Char
col BWORRES type=Char
col BWCUSTOM type=Char
---
S1 | BW | 001 | 1 | BW | Body Weight | 250 | X
---
